{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":485356,"name":"Alex Such","username":"Alex_Such","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/a/0ea827/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-07T13:13:49.956Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485356-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485356-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485356-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485356-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEvery message to any Grok Bot on this account fails with:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBot failed to respond\u003c/strong\u003e / \u003cstrong\u003eSomething went wrong while generating the reply. Try again.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChinese UI (exact): \u003cstrong\u003e「Bot 未能回复 / 生成回复时出错了。请重试。」\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is not one bad chat. It hits every bot on the account, including a short “?” / “1” / “在吗？” with no tools, connectors, search, or computer-use. The same account also fails on \u003cstrong\u003eiPhone\u003c/strong\u003e. Desktop and phone share the same dead Agent Computer.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFailed user messages stay local only: they have a \u003ccode\u003eclientNonce\u003c/code\u003e but \u003cstrong\u003eno \u003ccode\u003erequestId\u003c/code\u003e / sendAcceptance ack\u003c/strong\u003e. Last successful replies were \u003cstrong\u003e2026-09-06 19:47 CST\u003c/strong\u003e. First failure \u003cstrong\u003e2026-09-07 16:28 CST\u003c/strong\u003e. Desktop app was already on \u003cstrong\u003e0.44.0\u003c/strong\u003e (updated ~02:13 CST that morning). Account still shows signed in; the Agent Computer host still answers TLS (\u003ccode\u003eGET /\u003c/code\u003e → ALB \u003ccode\u003e404 The request could not be routed\u003c/code\u003e, which is normal). Cursor status page shows Grok Bot operational.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis matches today’s thread \u003ca href=\"https://forum.cursor.com/t/grokbot-can-not-send-msgs-agents-virtual-machine-is-still-visible/170843\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003eGrokbot | can not send msgs; agents' virtual machine is still visible\u003c/a\u003e and the earlier staff-confirmed “shared cloud computer stuck” reports (170661, 170731, 170235).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease recover / rebuild the Agent Computer on the backend for this account. I have \u003cstrong\u003enot\u003c/strong\u003e clicked Reset / Recover / Update, per staff guidance that a stuck computer cannot be fixed from the client and Reset can leave a partial state.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485356-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485356-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Grok Bot 0.44.0 on macOS (or the iOS app, same account).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen an existing bot or any bot on the account.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSend a short message such as “?” or “hello” with no tools.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWithin a few seconds the red banner appears.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFully quit (Cmd+Q) and reopen — same failure.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRepeat on iPhone with the same account — same failure.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485356-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485356-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eShort messages should get a reply on both Mac and iPhone. If the shared Agent Computer is stuck, please recover it server-side.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485356-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485356-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMacOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485356-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485356-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGrok Bot desktop: \u003cstrong\u003e0.44.0\u003c/strong\u003e (stable), bundle \u003ccode\u003ecom.anysphere.sand\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eiOS Grok Bot: same account, also fails\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTimezone: Asia/Shanghai (CST)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485356-for-ai-issues-add-request-id-with-privacy-disabled-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485356-for-ai-issues-add-request-id-with-privacy-disabled-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFor AI issues: add Request ID with privacy disabled\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFailed sends have \u003cstrong\u003eno requestId\u003c/strong\u003e. Conversation IDs:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003e0f4399d5-b29a-4e1b-bf80-765abba2043a\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003e24542bc8-480d-447a-802a-dddf6cfc18e9\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485356-additional-information-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485356-additional-information-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTried (did not fix): fully quit/reopen desktop, retry short messages, confirmed iPhone also dead.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDid \u003cstrong\u003enot\u003c/strong\u003e try: Reset / Recover / Update Agent Computer, sign out, reinstall.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease do not ask me to keep hitting Reset.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485356-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-9\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485356-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-9\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":1,"updated_at":"2026-09-07T13:24:16.486Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":21,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":105.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":170897,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-0-44-0-bot-failed-to-respond-on-mac-iphone-no-requestid-please-recover-agent-computer","display_username":"Alex Such","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://forum.cursor.com/t/grokbot-can-not-send-msgs-agents-virtual-machine-is-still-visible/170843","internal":true,"reflection":false,"title":"Grokbot | can not send msgs; agents' virtual machine is still visible","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":136620,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-0-44-0-bot-failed-to-respond-on-mac-iphone-no-requestid-please-recover-agent-computer/170897/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false}],"stream":[485356]},"timeline_lookup":[[1,0]],"suggested_topics":[],"tags":[{"id":272,"name":"chat","slug":"chat"},{"id":416,"name":"grok-bot","slug":"grok-bot"}],"tags_descriptions":{},"fancy_title":"Grok Bot 0.44.0 — Bot failed to respond on Mac + iPhone (no requestId); please recover Agent Comp